The request schemas are asymmetric: `AddMemoryRequest.memo: str = Field(min_length=1, max_length=500)` (api/schemas.py:276) versus `ReplaceMemoryRequest.memos: list[str] = Field(max_length=100)` (api/schemas.py:280) — the list length is bounded, the item length is not.

